            <li>Keeps your own tasks and events, your courses, and anything from ${esc(P.name)} you've changed${p.keep.length ? ` (${p.keep.length} task${p.keep.length === 1 ? "" : "s"}${p.evKeep ? `, ${p.evKeep} event${p.evKeep === 1 ? "" : "s"}` : ""}):` : "."}</li>
